These 4 French words DON'T mean what you think 😳🇫🇷

• une librairie = a bookstore
• une bibliothèque = a library
• actuellement = currently (not "actually")
• attendre = to wait (not "to attend")
• un faux ami = a false friend

😳 Which one surprised you? Comment 1️⃣ librairie 2️⃣ actuellement 3️⃣ attendre 👇
